OL,3,GNEWSAFears beach ramp closure will last
OL,4,Amonths
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents of a seaside resort are
OL,7,Fworried a damaged access path to their
OL,8,Fbeach will be closed for months.
OL,10,FA fallen section of the lower promenade
OL,11,Fat the southern end of Whitley Bay has
OL,12,Fbeen closed since 30 October and North
OL,13,FTyneside Council, which found slight
OL,14,Fmovement in the blocks on the side of
OL,15,Fthe ramp, has not yet given a date for
OL,16,Fwhen it will reopen.
OL,18,FDenise Foulds, who has lived in Whitley
OL,19,FBay for 40 years, said: "It's going to
OL,20,Fget worse over the winter with the
OL,21,Fstorms and the sea if they don't get it
OL,22,Frepaired now."
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
