OL,3,GNEWSAFears beach ramp closure will last
OL,4,Amonths
OL,5,
OL,6,FDog walker Bev Henderson said the ramp
OL,7,Fhas suffered frequent damage since it
OL,8,Fwas built in 2018 because "that's where
OL,9,Fthe waves are strongest when they come
OL,10,Fcrashing in".
